; the state is and-masked to stay 0, so bad (state == 1) never fires;
; the constraint (input nonzero) is irrelevant to that but sticky once violated
1 sort bitvec 4
2 sort bitvec 1
3 input 1 i
4 zero 1
5 state 1 s
6 init 1 5 4
7 constd 1 5
8 and 1 5 7
9 next 1 5 8
10 neq 2 3 4
11 constraint 10
12 one 1
13 eq 2 5 12
14 bad 13
